<title>FRANCE: Breakdown of EU grain export/import balance.</title>
<headline>Breakdown of EU grain export/import balance.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are details of EU grain export/import commitments as of March 4 in the July-to-June 1996/97 campaign, supplied by member country officials.</p>
<p>On March 6, the EU also granted exports of 436,500 tonnes of soft wheat, 398,000 tonnes of barley and 23,500 tonnes of oats.</p>
<p>Figures ('000 tonnes) are based on officially communicated certificates and are subject to revision.</p>
<p>			 ---------1996/97-------  ------1995/96-----</p>
<p>			     1Jul96 to 4Mar97	1Jul95 to 4Mar96</p>
<p>			 EXPORTS  PCT(1) IMPORTS  EXPORTS    IMPORTS</p>
<p>  Soft wheat(grain)  7,711     148     836    5,223	1,183</p>
<p>  Flour (2)	    5,036     144	11    3,497	   14</p>
<p>Food aid</p>
<p>    - grain		271	69	 -	393	    -</p>
<p>    - flour (2)	   98	82	 -	120	    -</p>
<p>Donations</p>
<p>    - grain		  0		   -	335	    -</p>
<p>    - flour (2)	   17		   -	 76	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL SOFT WHEAT   13,133     136     847    9,644	1,197</p>
<p>  Durum (grain)	  119		 417	 17	  940</p>
<p>  Semolina (3)	   302     863	 0	 35	    0</p>
<p>  Food aid		   1		   -	 68	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL DURUM WHEAT     422     352     417	120	  940</p>
<p> ALL WHEAT	    13,555     139   1,264    9,764	2,137</p>
<p>  Barley (grain)     4,549     365	31    1,248	  203</p>
<p>  Malt (4)	     2,661     121	 0    2,194	    0</p>
<p>  Donations		  0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL BARLEY	  7,210     209	31    3,442	  203</p>
<p>  Maize (grain)	  148   1,480   1,362	 10	2,321</p>
<p>  Food aid		  12		   -	 40	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL MAIZE	     160     320   1,362	 50	2,321</p>
<p>  Rye (grain)	    701	50	 3    1,416	   33</p>
<p>  Rye flour (5)	    4	13	 0	 32	    0</p>
<p>Donations</p>
<p>    - grain		  0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p>    - flour (5)	    0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL RYE		 705	49	 3    1,448	   33</p>
<p> OATS			399     493	 1	 81	    1</p>
<p>  Sorghum (grain)	  0		 155	  0	1,010</p>
<p>  Food aid		   0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL SORGHUM	     0		 155	  0	1,010</p>
<p>OTHER GRAINS Buckwheat, Millet,</p>
<p>   Triticale		 2		 161	  1	   97</p>
<p> TOTAL GRAIN	  22,031     149   2,977   14,786	5,802</p>
<p>Note -- (1) column shows this year's exports expressed as a percentage of last year's exports, not as a percentage change (2) wheat equivalent (3) durum equivalent (4) barley equivalent (5) rye equivalent. -- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5146</p>
